{
  "technical_and_design_decisions": [
    "U1 & U2: Provide Node.js bindings/wrappers and standardized API bridge interfaces to interact with Java and Python SDK capabilities and Fabric network endpoints.",
    "U3: Extend the chaincode deployment lifecycle and packaging format to support pre-compiled Docker images and binary targets, allowing peers to skip local source compilation.",
    "U4: Refactor VSCC policy evaluation to retain policy structure and signer MSP IDs during validation, logging detailed failure reasons (satisfied vs missing signatures) at INFO level and passing them to event/SDK failure messages.",
    "U5: Update Makefile and CI build pipelines to cross-compile binary releases for tools including configtxgen, fabric-chaintool, and fabric-ca-client across targeted operating systems (Linux, macOS, Windows).",
    "U6: Implement channel-level certificate fingerprint validation within MSP configuration and authentication handlers, verifying fingerprints against signed org lists or endpoints.",
    "U7: Structure quick-start test network scripts in fabric/test/ and update testing.html on ReadTheDocs with clear guidance and cross-links.",
    "U8: Audit all implicit default configurations across peer, orderer, gossip, and ledger subsystems, consolidating them into complete core.yaml, orderer.yaml, and configtx.yaml files inside sampleconfig/config_defaults."
  ],
  "assumptions": [
    "Development work is conducted within the standard Hyperledger Fabric repository structure using Go, shell scripts, and Docker.",
    "Existing unit and integration test frameworks are available to validate changes.",
    "Certificate fingerprint pinning changes will be backward-compatible with existing MSP configurations.",
    "All effort estimates are presented in developer workdays (1 workday = 8 hours)."
  ],
  "activities": [
    {
      "activity_id": "ACT-1",
      "activity_name": "SDK Wrapper & Interoperability Support (U1, U2)",
      "activity_description": "Implement Node.js interaction patterns and wrapper interfaces compatible with Java and Python SDK environments for Fabric application developers.",
      "most_likely_effort": 6
    },
    {
      "activity_id": "ACT-2",
      "activity_name": "Pre-built User Chaincode (UCC) Deployment (U3)",
      "activity_description": "Modify chaincode package parser and peer deployment logic to support pre-built target binaries and images without requiring local source builds on peers.",
      "most_likely_effort": 8
    },
    {
      "activity_id": "ACT-3",
      "activity_name": "VSCC Validation Logging & Event Enhancement (U4)",
      "activity_description": "Enhance VSCC policy evaluation engine to capture signer identities, evaluated policies, and missing signatures; output INFO logs and surface detailed errors in event notifications.",
      "most_likely_effort": 7
    },
    {
      "activity_id": "ACT-4",
      "activity_name": "Platform Tool Binaries Build Automation (U5)",
      "activity_description": "Update build scripts and packaging pipelines to generate pre-compiled platform-specific binaries for configtxgen, fabric-chaintool, fabric-ca-client, and related tools.",
      "most_likely_effort": 5
    },
    {
      "activity_id": "ACT-5",
      "activity_name": "Independent Certificate Fingerprint Pinning (U6)",
      "activity_description": "Implement channel and MSP configuration enhancements to load and verify CA certificate fingerprints against org-controlled lists and signing keys.",
      "most_likely_effort": 10
    },
    {
      "activity_id": "ACT-6",
      "activity_name": "Test Network Tooling & ReadTheDocs Documentation (U7)",
      "activity_description": "Consolidate quick-start test network utilities under fabric/test/ and update testing.html documentation with links and instructions.",
      "most_likely_effort": 3
    },
    {
      "activity_id": "ACT-7",
      "activity_name": "Consolidated Default Configuration Files (U8)",
      "activity_description": "Audit all subsystem default values across Go packages and produce comprehensive core.yaml, orderer.yaml, and configtx.yaml templates in config_defaults.",
      "most_likely_effort": 4
    },
    {
      "activity_id": "ACT-8",
      "activity_name": "Integration Testing & Validation",
      "activity_description": "Perform end-to-end integration testing across UCC deployment, detailed VSCC failure events, binary generation, cert validation, and configuration defaults.",
      "most_likely_effort": 5
    }
  ],
  "reported_total": {
    "most_likely_effort": 48
  }
}
```

